msgid ""
"Task 8: Smart Ingestion Engine\n"
"Scans the active material's topology from the Material Output node,\n"
"traces back through Principled BSDF or Sanctus Library NodeGroups,\n"
"and auto-populates the baking queue with detected map channels."
msgstr ""
"任务 8：智能摄取引擎\n"
"扫描材质输出节点的活跃材质拓扑结构，\n"
"沿 Principled BSDF 或 Sanctus 库节点组反向追溯，\n"
"并自动填充检测到的贴图通道到烘焙队列。"

msgid "Auto-Populate Queue"
msgstr "自动填充队列"

msgid "Automatically detect and populate the baking queue from the active material"
msgstr "从活跃材质中自动检测和填充烘焙队列"

msgid ""
"Smart replace: if a map of this type already exists in the queue,\n"
"update its socket path instead of replacing it. This preserves\n"
"mesh maps (AO, Curvature) and any manually added maps of other types.\n"
"\n"
"When adding a socket path, any existing flat value for the same material\n"
"is automatically removed since they are mutually exclusive."
msgstr ""
"智能替换：如果队列中已存在此类型的贴图，则更新其端口路径而非替换它。这可保留网格贴图（AO、曲率）以及任何手动添加的其他类型贴图。\n"
"\n"
"在添加端口路径时，任何为该材质的现有扁平值将自动移除，因为它们互斥。"

msgid "No Cycles Material Output node found in the active material"
msgstr "活跃材质中未找到 Cycles 材质输出节点"

msgid "Surface input of Material Output is not connected"
msgstr "材质输出的表面输入未连接"

msgid "Auto-populated {count} maps from Principled BSDF inside nodegroup"
msgstr "从 Principled BSDF 内自动填充了 {count} 个贴图"

msgid "Auto-populated {len(matched)} maps from nested NodeGroup"
msgstr "从嵌套节点组中自动填充了 {len(matched)} 个贴图"

msgid "Auto-populated {len(matched)} maps from Sanctus Library NodeGroup"
msgstr "自动生成的 {len(matched)} 个来自 Sanctus 库节点组的贴图"

msgid "Auto-populated {count} maps from Principled BSDF"
msgstr "自动生成的 {count} 个来自 Principled BSDF 的贴图"

msgid "Auto-Populate is optimized for Principled BSDF and Sanctus Library Node Groups"
msgstr "自动生成针对 Principled BSDF 和 Sanctus 库节点组进行了优化"

msgid ""
"Smart Ingestion: Scans the Principled BSDF inputs and applies selection criteria:\n"
"- Base Color / Roughness: ALWAYS added\n"
"- Metallic: only if connected or value > 0.0\n"
"- Alpha: only if connected or value < 1.0\n"
"- Normal / Displacement: only if connected\n"
"- For unconnected sockets that qualify, stores the slider value per-material\n"
"  using add_flat_value() so each material slot can have its own flat value."
msgstr ""
"智能导入：扫描 Principled BSDF 输入并应用筛选标准：\n"
"- 基础颜色/粗糙度：始终添加\n"
"- 金属性：仅当已连接或值>0.0 时添加\n"
"- 透明度：仅当已连接或值<1.0 时添加\n"
"- 法线/位移：仅当已连接时添加\n"
"- 对于符合条件的未连接输入口，使用 add_flat_value() 存储每个材质的滑块值，使每个材质槽位都能拥有自己的扁平值"

msgid "Add or update a map, storing the flat value per-material if no socket is connected."
msgstr "添加或更新贴图，如果没有端口连接则按材质存储扁平值"

msgid "Wrapper that can be invoked from the N-panel or context menu without asserts."
msgstr "可在 N 面板或上下文菜单中调用（无断言检查）"

msgid ""
"Removes a single BakeMap from the queue.\n"
"If the map is a mesh map (AO/Curvature), also unchecks the corresponding\n"
"checkbox in the settings so the UI stays in sync."
msgstr ""
"移除单个烘焙贴图。\n"
"如果该贴图为网格贴图（AO/曲率），也取消对应的复选框以保持界面同步"

msgid "Remove Map"
msgstr "移除贴图"

msgid "Remove this map from the baking queue"
msgstr "从烘焙队列中移除此贴图"

msgid "[OVERRIDE]{obj}.{attr}: {original} -> {override}"
msgstr "[OVERRIDE]{obj}.{attr}: {original} -> {override}"

msgid "allows for making temporary changes to the file. Instead of manually cleaning them up, this object takes care of restoring previous settings as long as `restore()` is called."
msgstr "允许对文件进行临时更改。无需手动清理，该对象只要调用 `restore()` 即可自动恢复先前设置."

msgid ""
"Baking in the Sanctus-Library addon is based on connecting output sockets to the material output node and baking them as colors. This is different from other baking addons\n"
"that mainly bake out mesh maps like normals, ambient occlusion etc."
msgstr "在 Sanctus-Library 插件中烘焙是基于将输出插孔连接到材质输出节点并烘焙为颜色。这与大多数主要烘焙法线、环境光遮蔽等网格图的烘焙插件不同."

msgid "Update callback: add/remove AO map when checkbox toggled."
msgstr "更新回调：当复选框切换时添加/删除 AO 图。"

msgid ""
"Update callback: add/remove Curvature map when checkbox toggled.\n"
"Also auto-detects the existing Subsurf modifier's subdivision type\n"
"and sets the curvature_subdivision_type to match."
msgstr ""
"更新回调：当复选框切换时添加/删除曲率图。\n"
"同时自动检测活动对象现有细分修改器的细分类型，并将 curvature_subdivision_type 设置为此值以匹配。"

msgid "Auto-detect the subdivision type from the active object's existing Subsurf modifier."
msgstr "从活动对象的现有细分修改器中自动检测细分类型。"

msgid "Add or remove a mesh map from the parent object's baking queue."
msgstr "向父对象的烘焙队列中添加或删除网格图。"

msgid "is a string path to a specific socket relative to a material. Use get_socket() to resolve the path to the referenced socket object. Because the path is stored a string. It's possible for this path to be invalidated"
msgstr "是相对于材质的特定插孔的路径字符串。使用 get_socket() 将路径解析为引用的插孔对象。因为路径以字符串形式存储，所以该路径可能会失效。"

msgid ""
"Description of what the baker generates. The map type serves as a default name for a map. Using map types, it is also possible to generate a PBR node setup from the bake results.\n"
"`socket_paths` is a collection of `SocketPath` objects. Because bake maps \"live\" on a `bpy.types.Object`, usually users will have one socket path for each material on the object. \n"
"Using multiple socket paths per bake map allows the result of multiple materials to be baked together."
msgstr ""
"描述烘焙器生成的内容。地图类型作为地图的默认名称。使用地图类型，还可以从烘焙结果生成 PBR 节点设置。\n"
"`socket_paths` 是 `SocketPath` 对象的集合。因为烘焙图“活”在 `bpy.types.Object` 上，用户通常会为每个材质使用一个插孔路径。\n"
"每次烘焙使用多个插孔路径允许将多个材质的结果一起烘焙。"

msgid "Map Name"
msgstr "地图名称"

msgid "Has Color?"
msgstr "是否有颜色？"

msgid "Enable when map bakes color information. Disable for maps like metallic, normal, roughness etc."
msgstr "启用时贴图会烘焙颜色信息。禁用则用于金属度、法线、粗糙"

msgid "Disable during bake"
msgstr "度等贴图.|||~|||在烘焙过程中禁用|||~|||禁用贴图。"

msgid "Disables the map during baking. Useful for temporarily disabling maps without losing their socket paths and settings."
msgstr "可用于临时禁用贴图而不丢失其插口路径和设置.|||~|"

msgid "Samples"
msgstr "||采样数|||~|||用于该贴图的渲染采样数。如果烘焙结果过于噪声，"

msgid "Render samples used for this map. Increase above 1 if the baking result is too noisy"
msgstr "则调高此值.|||~|||默认值覆盖|||为未连接插口的自动填充贴图存储自定义默认值。"

msgid "Default Value Override"
msgstr "当启用时，将使用此覆盖值而非 MapType 的默认值"

msgid "Stores a custom default value for auto-populated maps without socket connections. Used instead of the MapType default when set"
msgstr "|||~|||有默认值覆盖|||启用后，在没有插口路"

msgid "Has Default Override"
msgstr "径的情况下使用 default_value_overr"

msgid "When True, use default_value_override instead of the MapType default when no socket path exists"
msgstr "ide 替代 MapType 的默认值 |||~|||"

msgid "Auto-Populated"
msgstr "自动填充"

msgid "When True, this map was added by Auto-Populate. Only auto-populated Normal maps from Bump nodes get Object-to-Tangent conversion"
msgstr "当启用时，此图元由自动填充（Auto-Populate）生成。只有由噪点节点生成的自动填充法线贴图才会进行对象到切线转换"

msgid "Material {material.name} is already used in map \"{get_map_name()}\""
msgstr "材料 {material.name} 已在图元 \"{get_map_name()}\" 中使用"

msgid "Add a per-material flat value entry. Replaces any existing flat value for this material."
msgstr "添加每个材料的扁平值条目。将替换此材料的任何现有扁平值"

msgid ""
"Check if a material can be added to this map.\n"
"A material is available if it has no socket_path entry AND no flat_value entry."
msgstr ""
"检查材料是否可以添加到此图元中。\n"
"仅当该材料没有 socket_path 条目且没有 flat_value 条目时才可用"

msgid "Get the per-material flat value, or None if not set."
msgstr "获取每个材料的扁平值，或未设置时返回 None"

msgid "contains all of the \"general\" settings for baking"
msgstr "包含所有\"常规\"烘焙设置"

msgid "Resolution"
msgstr "分辨率"

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgid "Auto Margin"
msgstr "自动边缘"

msgid "Set the baking margin based on the resolution of the texture"
msgstr "根据纹理的分辨率设置烘焙边缘"

msgid "Margin"
msgstr "边缘余量"

msgid "Padding added to the edges of UV islands on the bake"
msgstr "为烘焙的 UV 岛添加边缘余量"

msgid "Auto Decal Settings"
msgstr "自动贴纸设置"

msgid "Automatically determine settings for decal baking. Works best on objets with applied scale and 0 decal offset"
msgstr "自动确定贴纸烘焙的设置。适用于应用了缩放且贴花偏移为 0 的对象"

msgid "Ray Distance"
msgstr "射线距离"

msgid "Length of the distance check to hit the target surface from a decal. Set to a value slighly larger than the maximum distance a decal is away from the surface. Scales with object scale"
msgstr "从贴花到目标表面探测的距离检查长度。设置为略大于贴花与表面最大距离的值。随物体比例缩放"

msgid "Bake Decals"
msgstr "烘焙贴花"

msgid ""
"Include decals from Sanctus Library on this object in the bake.\n"
"Roughly doubles the processing time"
msgstr ""
"将此对象上的圣徒库中的贴纸包含在烘焙中。\n"
"粗略将处理时间翻倍"

msgid "Bake Ambient Occlusion"
msgstr "烘焙环境遮蔽"

msgid "Bake a native Ambient Occlusion map"
msgstr "烘焙原生环境遮蔽贴图"

msgid "Bake Curvature"
msgstr "烘焙曲率"

msgid "Bake a Curvature (Cavity) map using Blender's Dirty Vertex Colors. Highlights edges (white) and crevices (black)."
msgstr "使用 Blender 的脏顶点颜色烘焙曲率（凹槽）贴图。突出显示边缘（白色）和凹陷（黑色）。"

msgid "Subdivision Levels"
msgstr "细分层级"

msgid "Temporarily subdivide the mesh during the curvature calculation. 0 disables subdivision"
msgstr "在曲率计算期间临时对网格进行细分。0 禁用细分"

msgid "Subdivision Type"
msgstr "细分类型"

msgid "Subdivision algorithm used during curvature baking."
msgstr "在曲率烘焙期间使用的细分算法."

msgid "Bake Direct Light"
msgstr "烘焙直射光"

msgid "Bake direct lighting into the Base Color map."
msgstr "将直射光照烘焙到基础色贴图。"

msgid "Bake Indirect Light"
msgstr "烘焙间接光"

msgid "Bake indirect lighting into the Base Color map."
msgstr "将间接光照烘焙到基础色贴图。"

msgid "Inherit Normal"
msgstr "继承法线"

msgid "Decals inherit surface normal. When enabled, decal normals blend with the underlying surface normals instead of overwriting them"
msgstr "贴图继承表面法线。启用时，贴图法线与底层表面法线混合而不是覆盖它们"

msgid "Pack ORM Texture"
msgstr "打包 ORM 纹理"

msgid "Pack AO, Roughness, and Metallic maps into a single composite ORM texture map (R=AO, G=Roughness, B=Metallic)"
msgstr "将 AO、粗糙度和金属度贴图打包到一个综合 ORM 纹理映射中（R=AO，G=粗糙度，B=金属度）"

msgid "Override Texture Sets"
msgstr "覆盖纹理集"

msgid "Override existing texture sets and images. New sets and images are created when disabled"
msgstr "覆盖现有的纹理集和图像。禁用时创建新的集合和图像"

msgid "Apply user preferences to this settings instance on first access."
msgstr "首次访问时将用户首选项应用到此设置实例。"

msgid "contains bake settings and a list of bake maps"
msgstr "包含烘焙设置和烘焙贴图列表"

msgid "Get or create the BakingQueue for an object."
msgstr "获取或创建对象的渲染队列。"

msgid "Load post handler: apply prefs to all queues when a blend file is loaded."
msgstr "加载后处理器：在导入 .blend 文件时向所有队列应用首选项。"

msgid "Periodic timer: apply prefs to any new objects that haven't been initialized yet."
msgstr "周期性计时器：对尚未初始化的任何新对象应用首选项"

msgid "Apply user preferences to all BakingQueueSettings that haven't been initialized yet."
msgstr "对所有未初始化过的 BakingQueueSettings 应用用户首选项"

msgid "User-configurable default baking settings stored in addon preferences."
msgstr "存储在插件首选项中的可用户自定义默认烘焙设置"

msgid "Default Baking Export Format"
msgstr "默认烘焙导出格式"

msgid "Default Export format for baked images"
msgstr "烘焙图像的默认导出格式"

msgid "Default bake resolution for new baking queues"
msgstr "新烘焙队列的默认烘焙分辨率"

msgid "Enable auto margin by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "为新烘焙队列启用自动边距（按默认）"

msgid "Margin (pixels)"
msgstr "边距（像素）"

msgid "Default margin in pixels for new baking queues"
msgstr "新烘焙队列的默认边距（像素）"

msgid "Pack ORM texture by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "为新烘焙队列默认打包 ORM 纹理"

msgid "Ambient Occlusion"
msgstr "环境遮蔽|||~|||为"

msgid "Bake AO by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "新烘焙队列默认烘焙环境遮"

msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "蔽|||~|||曲率||"

msgid "Bake Curvature by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "|~|||为新烘焙队列默"

msgid "Bake decals by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "认烘焙曲率|||~|||"

msgid "Decal Inherits Normal"
msgstr "为新烘焙队列默认烘焙贴图"

msgid "Decals inherit surface normal by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "|||~|||贴图继承法"

msgid "Direct Light"
msgstr "向|||~|||贴图默认"

msgid "Bake direct light by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "继承表面法向用于新烘焙队"

msgid "Indirect Light"
msgstr "列|||~|||直射光|||~|||间接光"

msgid "Bake indirect light by default for new baking queues"
msgstr "烘焙间接光为新的烘焙队列的默认设置"

msgid "Base Color"
msgstr "基础颜色"

msgid "Default samples for Base Color maps"
msgstr "基础颜色图的默认采样数"

msgid "Metallic"
msgstr "金属度"

msgid "Default samples for Metallic maps"
msgstr "金属度图的默认采样数"

msgid "Specular"
msgstr "高光"

msgid "Default samples for Specular maps"
msgstr "高光图的默认采样数"

msgid "Roughness"
msgstr "粗糙度"

msgid "Default samples for Roughness maps"
msgstr "粗糙度图的默认采样数"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "法线"

msgid "Default samples for Normal maps"
msgstr "法线贴图的默认采样"

msgid "Displacement"
msgstr "置换"

msgid "Default samples for Displacement maps"
msgstr "置换贴图的默认采样"

msgid "Emission"
msgstr "发光"

msgid "Default samples for Emission maps"
msgstr "发光贴图的默认采样"

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alpha"

msgid "Default samples for Alpha maps"
msgstr "Alpha 通道的默认采样"

msgid "Other"
msgstr "其他"

msgid "Default samples for custom/Other maps"
msgstr "自定义/其他贴图的默认采样"

msgid "Default samples for Ambient Occlusion maps"
msgstr "环境光遮蔽贴图的默认采样"

msgid "EXR Color Depth"
msgstr "EXR 颜色深度"

msgid "Default bit depth when exporting OpenEXR textures in bulk save. Normal/Displacement maps use 16-bit by default."
msgstr "批量导出 OpenEXR 纹理时的默认位深。法线/位移贴图默认使用 16 位。"

msgid "EXR Codec"
msgstr "EXR 编码器"

msgid "Default compression codec when exporting OpenEXR textures in bulk save. ZIP (lossless) is the safest default."
msgstr "批量导出 OpenEXR 纹理时的默认压缩编码。ZIP（无损）是最安全的默认选项。"

msgid "Return the user's preferred default sample count for a given MapType."
msgstr "返回给定 MapType 的用户首选采样数。"

msgid "Apply these preferences to a BakingQueueSettings instance."
msgstr "将这些偏好应用到 BakingQueueSettings 实例。"

msgid "temporary override node setup when baking maps. Makes sure that after baking, the previous state is restored if `clean_up()` is called. Abstracts away the need to manually connect nodes for baking"
msgstr "烘焙贴图时使用的临时节点设置。确保在调用 clean_up() 后恢复之前的状态。抽象掉了手动连接节点进行烘焙的需求。"

msgid "Could not create setup because material <{material.name}> does not have a valid material output socket available"
msgstr "无法创建设置，因为材质 \"<{material.name}>\" 没有可用的有效材质输出端口。"

msgid "Check if a socket lives inside a nested group tree (not the material's top-level tree)."
msgstr "检查一个端口是否嵌套在组树中（而非材质的顶层树）。"

msgid ""
"When a socket is inside a nested group, add a temporary output to the\n"
"outermost group's interface, connect the socket to it, and return the\n"
"corresponding output socket on the Group node in the material tree.\n"
"\n"
"Like Node Wrangler's Ctrl+Shift+click: modifies the group in place but\n"
"tracks the added interface items for cleanup."
msgstr ""
"当端口嵌套在组内时，在最外层组的接口中添加一个临时输出，连接该端口，并返回材质树中 Group 节点上的相应输出端口。\n"
"\n"
"与 Node Wrangler 的 Ctrl+Shift+点击类似：就地修改组但会跟踪已添加的接口项以便清理。"

msgid "This module contains the PropertyGroups for bake results"
msgstr "该模块包含烘焙结果的 PropertyGroups"

msgid "A wrapper for a `bpy.types.Image` pointer. Each bake texture also has a map type. This matches the map type of the baking queue"
msgstr "一个指向 `bpy.types.Image` 的包装器。每个烘焙贴图都有一个贴图类型，这与烘焙队列中的贴图类型一致。"

msgid "a collection of bake textures. Each baking process creates a new `TextureSet` unless existing textures are overridden"
msgstr "是烘焙贴图的集合。除非覆盖现有贴图，否则每个烘焙过程都会创建一个新的 `TextureSet`。"

msgid "contains all baked texture sets. Instead of being stored for each object, all texture sets are stored globally so they are accessibly from every object"
msgstr "包含所有已烘焙的纹理集。而不是为每个对象存储它们，所有纹理集都全局存储以便从任何对象访问。"

msgid "Reverse Sorting"
msgstr "逆序排序"

msgid "Reverse the sorting of displayed texture sets"
msgstr "反转显示的纹理集的排序顺序"

msgid "Show Only Local Sets"
msgstr "仅显示本地集合"

msgid "When enabled, show only sets with the same name as the active object"
msgstr "启用时，只显示与活动对象名称相同的集合"

msgid "Implements the UI for both the `queue` and `texture_sets` modules"
msgstr "实现 `queue` 和 `texture_sets` 模块的 UI"

msgid "Is Baking"
msgstr "是否在进行烘焙"

msgid "Get the 1-based material slot index for a given material on an object."
msgstr "获取对象上给定材质的 1-based 材质槽索引。"

msgid "{slot_prefix}Invalid Socket Path"
msgstr "{slot_prefix}无效的 Socket 路径"

msgid "Add Socket"
msgstr "添加 Socket"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

msgid "Clear"
msgstr "清除"

msgid "Auto-Populate from Material"
msgstr "从材质自动填充"

msgid "Missing image. Data block has been removed"
msgstr "缺少图像。数据块已被删除"

msgid "General collection of utility function and classes around the baking process"
msgstr "围绕烘焙过程的通用工具函数和类集合"

msgid ""
"Queries Blender's active OCIO config for valid color space identifiers\n"
"at runtime by probing a temporary image's ColorSpaceSettings RNA instance.\n"
"\n"
"The temp-image approach is necessary because bpy.types.ColorSpaceSettings\n"
"is not a standalone RNA type in Blender 4.0+ — it only exists as a nested\n"
"property on actual image data blocks."
msgstr ""
"通过探测临时图像的 ColorSpaceSettings RNA 实例，在运行时查询 Blender 的 active OCIO 配置中的有效颜色空间标识符。\n"
"\n"
"temp-image 方法是必要的，因为在 Blender 4.0+ 中，bpy.types.ColorSpaceSettings 不是一个独立的 RNA 类型——它仅作为实际图像数据块上的嵌套属性存在。"

msgid "Linear Rec.709"
msgstr "Linear Rec.709"

msgid ""
"Queries the active OCIO config's 'scene_linear' role to determine the\n"
"actual working color space.\n"
"\n"
"This is the definitive detection method — it reads the same OCIO config\n"
"that Blender's 'wm.set_working_color_space' operator writes to.\n"
"\n"
"Returns:\n"
"    str: The working space name (e.g. \"Linear Rec.709\", \"ACEScg\")."
msgstr ""
"查询活动 OCIO 配置的\"scene_linear\"角色以确定实际的色域。\n"
"\n"
"这是最终检测方法——它会读取与 Blender 的 'wm.set_working_color_space' 操作符写入相同的 OCIO 配置。\n"
"\n"
"返回：\n"
"    str: 工作空间名称（例如 \"Linear Rec.709\"、\"ACEScg\"）。"

msgid "Linear - ACEScg"
msgstr "Linear - ACEScg"

msgid "ACES - ACEScg"
msgstr "ACES - ACEScg"

msgid "ACEScg (Linear)"
msgstr "ACEScg (Linear)"

msgid ""
"Quick check if the active OCIO config is ACES-based.\n"
"\n"
"Uses the 'scene_linear' role from PyOpenColorIO for definitive detection.\n"
"Falls back to checking available color spaces for ACEScg tokens."
msgstr ""
"快速检查活动 OCIO 配置是否为 ACES 基础。\n"
"\n"
"使用 PyOpenColorIO 的 'scene_linear' 角色进行最终检测。\n"
"如果失败，则回退到检查可用色域以查找 ACEScg token。"

msgid ""
"Returns the appropriate image color space for Color/Albedo maps.\n"
"\n"
"Baked data from Cycles is always in linear working-space values\n"
"(Linear Rec.709 or ACEScg depending on OCIO config). The image\n"
"in memory always stores linear data, so we tag it as \"Linear Rec.709\"\n"
"regardless of export format.\n"
"\n"
"The conversion to sRGB gamma happens ONLY at save time:\n"
"- SaveTextureSet uses image.save_render() which applies the\n"
"  view transform (Standard → sRGB encoding) automatically.\n"
"- SaveBakeTexture uses save_as(save_as_render=False) which saves\n"
"  raw pixels — the user is responsible for setting the correct\n"
"  color space on the saved file.\n"
"\n"
"Args:\n"
"    user_format: The user's preferred export format (e.g. \"PNG\", \"OPEN_EXR\").\n"
"\n"
"Returns:\n"
"    str: Always \"Linear Rec.709\" — the working space for linear data."
msgstr ""
"返回用于 Color/Albedo 图的合适图像色域。\n"
"\n"
"Cycles 渲染数据始终以线性工作空间值存储（取决于 OCIO 配置为 Linear Rec.709 或 ACEScg）。内存中的图像始终存储线性数据，因此无论导出格式如何，我们都将其标记为 \"Linear Rec.709\"。\n"
"\n"
"转换到 sRGB 伽马仅发生在保存时：\n"
"- SaveTextureSet 使用 image.save_render()，自动应用视口变换（Standard → sRGB 编码）。\n"
"- SaveBakeTexture 使用 save_as(save_as_render=False) 进行保存，直接保存原始像素——用户需要在保存的文件上设置正确的色域。\n"
"\n"
"参数:\n"
"    user_format: 用户偏好的导出格式（例如 \"PNG\"、\"OPEN_EXR\"）。\n"
"\n"
"返回：\n"
"    str: 始终为 \"Linear Rec.709\" —— 线性数据的存储空间。"

msgid "Returns the safe identifier for non-color data maps (Normal, Roughness, etc.)."
msgstr "返回非着色数据图（法线、粗糙度等）的安全标识符。"

msgid ""
