msgid ""
"Finalize a baked texture by updating pixels, packing, and verifying settings.\n"
"No color space assignment is performed if it already matches to protect the float buffer.\n"
"\n"
"CRITICAL: Reassigning a different color space to an in-memory float image\n"
"(one without a backing file path) will flush the pixel buffer to black.\n"
"The color space should already be set during create_new_image() — this function\n"
"only changes it if there's a mismatch, as a safety net.\n"
"\n"
"Args:\n"
"    image: The Blender image to finalize.\n"
"    colorspace_str: The target color space string (e.g. \"sRGB\", \"ACEScg\", \"Non-Color\").\n"
"    skip_conversion: Kept for API compatibility (no longer used)."
msgstr ""
"通过更新像素、打包和验证设置来完成烘焙纹理。如果色彩空间已经匹配，则不会执行任何颜色空间分配以保护浮点缓冲器。\n"
"\n"
"关键：将不同的色彩空间重新赋给内存中的浮动图像（没有备份文件路径）会导致像素缓冲器被清空为黑色。\n"
"应在 create_new_image() 期间先设置色彩空间——本函数仅在检测到不匹配时作为安全网才更改它。\n"
"\n"
"参数:\n"
"    image: 要完成的 Blender 图像。\n"
"    colorspace_str: 目标色彩空间字符串（例如 \"sRGB\"、\"ACEScg\"、\"Non-Color\"）。\n"
"    skip_conversion: 保留以 API 兼容性（不再使用）。"

