msgid ""
"Creates a reusable node group that converts Object-space normals to Tangent-space.\n"
"Uses the mathematical approach: Dot Product and Cross Product against the geometry's\n"
"Tangent and Normal vectors, then remaps from [-1,1] to [0,1] range.\n"
"\n"
"The node group has:\n"
"- Input: 'Color' (Vector) — the Object-space normal vector\n"
"- Output: 'Vector' (Vector) — the Tangent-space normal in [0,1] range\n"
"\n"
"This allows Bump nodes and procedural normals to be baked correctly\n"
"without switching the bake engine from EMIT to NORMAL."
msgstr ""
"如果未找到则返回 None.|||~|||创建一个可复用的节点组，将物体空间法线转换为切线空间。\n"
"使用数学方法：对几何体的切线和法向量执行点积和叉积，然后将范围从 [-1, 1] 重映射到 [0, 1]。"

